# Day 005 - ATM Project

## Concepts Used
- while loop for the menu
- switch for choices
- if-else for validation

## Requirements

1. Check Balance
2. Deposit
3. Withdraw (cannot exceed balance)
4. Exit
5. PIN check with 3 attempts

## Flow


Enter PIN (max 3 tries) -> Show Menu -> Choose option -> Repeat until Exit


## Starter Code

java
int balance = 5000;
int choice;
do {
    System.out.println("1.Balance 2.Deposit 3.Withdraw 4.Exit");
    choice = sc.nextInt();
    switch (choice) {
        case 1: System.out.println("Balance: " + balance); break;
        case 2: /* add amount */ break;
        case 3: /* check balance first */ break;
    }
} while (choice != 4);


